            <strong class="text-brand-dark text-sm block">¥25,000 - ¥40,000 /月</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-400 block text-xs">包含电信/联通/移动三网对等</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 space-y-1">
